[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=System Monitor
Name[ko]=시스템 모니터
Comment=CPU, memory, disk, battery, network and API audit
Comment[ko]=CPU, 메모리, 디스크, 배터리, 네트워크, API 기록
Exec=/usr/local/bin/grokbot-webapp sysmon
